title: "geoscales: Nested Regions and Spatial Hierarchies for Modeling"
abstract: >-
  Discrete spatial representations for optimization and simulation models,
  including nested sets of regions, conversion between alternative spatial
  resolutions, and mapping of data onto region hierarchies for modeling and
  visualization.
